  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1500.html",
  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1505.02 Required Construction Practices",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1505.02 Required Construction Practices. The following construction practices shall apply:\n\n(a) Perimeter controls shall be installed prior to earth moving operations;\n\n(b) Stormwater treatment ponds and drainage swales shall be installed before rough grading the site;\n\n(c) Runoff shall be directed to temporary practices until stormwater control measures are stabilized;\n\n(d) Basins, ditches, and swales shall be stabilized prior to directing runoff to them; and\n\n(e) Erosion control practices shall be inspected at least weekly and after every rain event of 0.5 inch or more, provided that the inspections shall be conducted by the environmental monitor if one is required pursuant to Env-Wq 1505.03(b).\n\nSource. #9343, eff 1-1-09; ss by #12342, eff 8-15-17; ss by #14472, eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES: 1-19-36; ss by #14656, eff 8-6-26, EXPIRES: 8-6-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1500.html"
